# Open Licensing & Attribution Notice — NOUinnsikt Open Raw-Data Archive

This repository and its accompanying GitHub Release archives contain three distinct layers of open public knowledge and software, each licensed permissively for academic, journalistic, public-sector, civic, and commercial reuse:

---

## 1. Official Norwegian Public-Sector Documents & Parliamentary Records — NLOD 2.0 / Public Domain

All underlying official texts of *Norges offentlige utredninger* (NOUs, 1972–2026), Royal Decree (*Statsråd*) appointment records, public consultation metadata (*høringer*), Government White Papers and Bills (*Meld. St.*, *Prop. L*, *Prop. S*), Stortinget roll-call votes and resolutions (*voteringer* and *stortingsvedtak*), and enacted statutory references originate from official Norwegian public institutions:

- **Regjeringen.no** (Departementenes sikkerhets- og serviceorganisasjon / Ministries)
- **Nasjonalbiblioteket (`nb.no`)** & **UiO DUO Vitenarkiv** (historical digitized NOUs 1972–1993)
- **Stortinget (`data.stortinget.no`)** (open parliamentary proceedings and voting API)
- **Lovdata (`lovdata.no`)** (promulgated statutory identifiers and enactment dates)

Under the Norwegian Copyright Act (*Åndsverkloven § 14*), laws, regulations, court decisions, and official public deliberations/commission inquiries published by public authorities are exempt from copyright protection. Re-use of structured public-sector datasets follows the **Norwegian Licence for Open Government Data (NLOD 2.0)** (`https://data.norge.no/nlod/no/2.0`), which is compatible with **CC BY 4.0**. Please attribute the originating official source when quoting verbatim NOU passages.

---

## 2. NOUinnsikt Curated Datasets, Enrichments & Audio Overviews — CC BY 4.0

All value-added structured datasets, OCR-washed text normalizations, scrubbed 20,250-record committee & organizational rosters, 2-tier public administration taxonomy classifications, 626-item minority dissent catalog, 54-year corporatist & gender diversity metrics, inter-NOU citation graphs, legislative measure-to-statute alignments, Nynorsk executive summaries, 768-dimensional vector embeddings, and 758 synthesized dual-host audio overviews (MP3) are licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)**:

- License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- Required attribution: **"NOUinnsikt Open Archive (1972–2026)"** with a link to this GitHub repository.

---

